WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.371
Your first ten minutes in GTA 6

00:00:03.371 --> 00:00:06.260
can quietly wreck your entire playthrough.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:12.624
Four regrets players are about to make — and you can’t undo any of them.

00:00:12.624 --> 00:00:14.300
Stay till number one.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.825
Regret four: skipping the opening.

00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:20.875
Everyone smash-skips the intro to get to the game —

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:24.520
and misses the setup the whole story leans on.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:30.732
Regret three: spending your first cash the second you get it.

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:33.328
Cars, clothes, snacks — gone.

00:00:33.328 --> 00:00:39.040
The players who wait? They own the city by week one.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.440
Regret two: ignoring the tutorial prompts.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.373
It feels like babysitting.

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:49.690
But every hint you skip is an hour you lose later.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.286
Regret one: the irreversible choice.

00:00:52.286 --> 00:00:56.059
Some things in this game do NOT come back.

00:00:56.059 --> 00:01:01.090
Treat every early decision like it is permanent — because it is.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:04.737
Slow down in your first ten minutes —

00:01:04.737 --> 00:01:07.490
and the next hundred hours open up.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:10.776
Which regret almost got you?

00:01:10.776 --> 00:01:15.790
One, two, three, or four — comment the number.

